 "remarks": "Welcome to 237 Strawberry Hill Ave #37, a beautifully updated 3-bedroom, 2.5-bath townhouse in sought-after Pinewood Estates offering approximately 1,960 sq ft across three levels. The light-filled main level features recently refinished hardwood floors, a wood-burning fireplace, custom built-ins and moulding, plus a renovated kitchen with updated cabinetry and added pantry storage. Upstairs, the spacious primary suite includes a private bath, while two additional bedrooms and a full hall bath complete the level. The finished lower level offers flexible space for a home office, gym, playroom or media room, along with direct access to a large private 1-car garage. Excellent storage includes additional lower-level storage plus attic space. Major improvements include updated heating and cooling systems in 2022 and hardwood floors refinished in 2025. Enjoy a private deck, natural gas heat, central air, visitor parking and access to Pinewood Estates' fenced, heated in-ground pool. Conveniently located near downtown Stamford, Metro-North, shopping, dining, parks and Sterling Farms. Do not miss this spacious, move-in-ready townhouse offering exceptional flexibility, storage and convenience.",
